  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA value remains network-concentrated:</strong> the top chains continue to capture the majority of distributed issuance and often set near-term market direction. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNSmR1dWp2Tnp4NXVEYVJBeXB3M0JJUTJ1Z3BBVmRhUmZ0REk3eVA5dUxVSXR4Snc5VWF4UnV0QVZuV2oyZzVZejE5aDhtV1MwNGp3YU1VbWhGb2ZIdVhpc2lsRkExV0RsX2t3NVdJSk1iSlRUUEJTeUtyY1BPTDlVRlNLRWxuZU1FejhxUFFtdG1NNEJJWTNGMEpkNm5sbXlLYm4yNDBtT2E0YXJHWXJOS1ZKa19UNWZsSkY3SjdjZGs5QUE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bitcoin market update /w Bitfinex, Moca Network goes live</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Institutional expansion is likely staged:</strong> large-scale adoption typically lands on proven networks first, then broadens as compliance, interoperability, and liquidity deepen. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOYUUyZzBReEpiOHdwYUFqREJuVGVFcUdVNjBnUkNOalpIMXE4b0pBV0swSW5GekFQRl9sNTRGWW05RV8xN2tPNUIzbEpoMFdBZGJUM3VvdDRPZkVQNjhCcXlLcEwxdHBEcURyUDhZNzU3QjRlQWg0U2xUc3dIRXNZNEFqdnVXQ1FlUF9RWE1oNEtuUGRoempiYUl4WkVxNEJzU3psWEhRQ1JSeGUzZVhCMDJqb0FFUHZJUU95bTRDUUkxel9tekNTM0Rfakg?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">New stablecoin Open USD goes live as Coinbase, Mastercard, Stripe and Visa commit $1 billion to liquidity - coindesk.com</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Custody and issuance integrations are moving rankings first:</strong> Chains that win custody and issuance integrations usually pull distributed value share before the broader RWA market total catches up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-09-30-crypto-advocacy-group-stand-with-crypto-first-senate-endorsements-after-failed-clarity-417223\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Crypto advocacy group Stand With Crypto rolls out its first round of Senate endorsements after failed Clarity vote</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
